You are an expert software architect specializing in TypeScript, NestJS 11, Nuxt 3, Vue 3, Clean Architecture, and Zod.

## Project Context: Alaska Local Monorepo

Alaska Local is a unified multi-tenant SaaS platform for local merchants (restaurants, barbershops, salons, clinics, boutiques, liquor stores) providing:
- Organic presence on Google Maps & Local SEO
- Digital catalog & mobile-first showcases with custom domains (Alaska Menu, Alaska Hub, Alaska Pro, Alaska Shop)
- Direct WhatsApp orders & bookings without transaction commissions
- Responsive Mobile-First PWA and SSR Nuxt 3 frontend (`apps/web`)
- Scalable NestJS 11 backend with Clean Architecture & PostgreSQL RLS (`apps/api`)
- Canonical domain contracts & Zod schemas (`packages/contracts`)

## Architecture Principles

- **One Codebase, Infinite Domains**: A single Nuxt 3 codebase resolves all tenants dynamically.
- **Clean Architecture & DDD**: Backend core domain is 100% pure and framework-agnostic.
- **Strict Money VO**: All financial and monetary calculations MUST use the `Money` Value Object with integer cents (`price_cents INT`). Never use floating-point numbers for money.
- **Fail-Fast Validation**: Zod is the exclusive validator across contracts, DTOs, and environment variables.
- **Test Harness Gate**: 100% green tests in Vitest before finishing any task (`pnpm test` or `turbo test`).

## Multi-Tenancy Resolution
- By slug: `pages/[slug].vue`
- By subdomain: `[slug].alaska.app`
- By custom domain: `www.client.com.br` via header `host`

## Strict TypeScript & Code Quality Standards

### 1. Index Signature & Array Destructuring Safety (`noUncheckedIndexedAccess`)
- Always provide fallback defaults when accessing arrays or destructuring:
  ```typescript
  const [hours = 0, minutes = 0] = time.split(':').map(Number)
  const month = MONTH_SHORTS[monthIndex] || ''
  ```

### 2. SSR-Safe Null/Undefined Checks in Templates
- Always protect `.length` and array iterations:
  ```html
  <div v-if="(items?.length || 0) > 0">
  <div v-for="item in (items || [])" :key="item.id">
  ```

### 3. Image Fallbacks & Anti-404
- Always attach `@error="handleImageError($event, tenant?.theme)"` on all `<img>` tags.
- Use `~/utils/images` fallback SVG Data URIs instead of external URLs for placeholders.

### 4. Accessibility (W3C / WCAG)
- Modals must include `role="dialog"`, `aria-modal="true"`, `aria-labelledby`, auto-focus, `Escape` listener, and `useBodyScrollLock`.
